[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":111},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-unesco-mena-scholarship-programme-msp-2026-in-netherlands-full-application-guide-182":3},{"news":4,"more":28},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":27},182,"unesco-mena-scholarship-programme-msp-2026-in-netherlands-full-application-guide-182","Unesco Mena Scholarship Programme (msp) 2026 In Netherlands: Full Application Guide","\u003Cp>The Dutch Ministry of Foreign Affairs has provided funding for the 2026 UNESCO\u002FIHE Delft MENA Scholarship Programe (2026) as the framework of capacity building for professionals from a certain number of regions\u002Fcountries.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>MENA Scholarship Programme (MSP) 2026 Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Scholarship Host: Dutch Government | UNESCO\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: Netherlands\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fpostgraduate-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Postgraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fmasters-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Masters Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Tuition\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Accommodation\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>€13,380 Stipends\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Travel Costs\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: 11 Selected Countries\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Deadline: June 1, 2026\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>MENA Scholarship Programme (MSP) 2026 Details\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The IHE Delft Water and Development Partnership Programme, funded by the Dutch Ministry of Foreign Affairs, is providing scholarships in the framework of capacity strengthening and nurturing network of water professionals.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>IHE Delft Institute for Water formerly known as UNESCO-IHE Institute for Water Education is the largest international graduate water education facility in the world and is based in Delft, Netherlands.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Delft is a world renowned knowledge centre on water infrastructure, technology and sciences, and attracts high-level students and scientists from around the globe.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Benefits of IHE Delft Scholarship Programme\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The scholarship includes the total cost of the MSc Programme in Water and Sustainable Development:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>tuition fee,\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>an allowance of EURO 1,115 per month for the cost of living\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>insurance,\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>international travel cost and \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>accommodation during the complete study period.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Requirements for UNESCO MENA Scholarship 2026\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be considered for the MENA Scholarship Programme (MSP) 2026, you must satisfy the following criteria;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Have academic admission to the MSc Programme in Water and Sustainable Development\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be living and\u002For working in one of the eligible countries (Algeria, Egypt, Iran, Iraq, Jordan, Lebanon, Libya, Mauritania, Morocco, Oman and Tunisia.).\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Agree to conduct MSc research in their country\u002Fregion associated with one of the projects implement(ed) by the Programme.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Show active participation in and contribute to the seminars organized for the learning networks of the Programme.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Confirm to return to country of origin or other priority country of the programme.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Required Documents for IHE Delft MENA Scholarship\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>While applying for the 2026 IHE Delft MENA Scholarship, you will be required to submit the following documents;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Complete Application Form\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Academic Transcripts\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Bachelors\u002F Diploma Certificate (Masters)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Personal Statement\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Recommendation Letters\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Proof of English Language Proficiency \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>How To Apply for IHE Delft MENA Scholarship\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply, follow the instructions below;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Visit the scholarship application portal using the button below\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Apply for an admission to the MSc Programme in Water and Sustainable Development \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>You do not have to complete a separate application form. If you are a national from one of the eligible countries, you will automatically be considered for the scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>If you are from one of these countries and interested in studying at IHE Delft, we advise you to apply for admission as soon as possible.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>You will receive the outcome of your scholarship selection by 1 July 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.un-ihe.org\u002Feducation\u002Fmaster-programmes\u002Fsahel-mena-and-horn-africa-scholarships#:~:text=The%20IHE%20Delft%20Water%20and,un-ihe.org\">https:\u002F\u002Fwww.un-ihe.org\u002Feducation\u002Fmaster-programmes\u002Fsahel-mena-and-horn-africa-scholarships#:~:text=The%20IHE%20Delft%20Water%20and,un%2Dihe.org\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-04-24 12:43:35",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Funesco-mena-scholarship-programme-msp-2026-in-netherlands-full-application-guide\u002F69eb576780d434.56883866_screenshot 2026-04-24 123952.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Funesco-mena-scholarship-programme-msp-2026-in-netherlands-full-application-guide\u002F69eb576780d434.56883866_screenshot%202026-04-24%20123952.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",3,[29,39,48,58,67,76,85,94,102],{"id":30,"slug":31,"title":32,"images":33,"datePosted":37,"authorName":38},305,"dartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Dartmouth College Kings Scholarship Usa 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[34],{"fileName":35,"oldFileName":35,"type":18,"file":19,"url":36},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot 2026-06-24 204255.png","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot%202026-06-24%20204255.png","2026-06-24 20:51:19","LINKSKOOL",{"id":40,"slug":41,"title":42,"images":43,"datePosted":47,"authorName":9},304,"mexican-government-scholarship-for-foreigners-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Mexican Government Scholarship For Foreigners 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[44],{"fileName":45,"oldFileName":45,"type":18,"file":19,"url":46},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fmexican-government-scholarship-for-foreigners-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c32aaeb8a11.62235495_screenshot 2026-06-24 201924.png","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fmexican-government-scholarship-for-foreigners-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c32aaeb8a11.62235495_screenshot%202026-06-24%20201924.png","2026-06-24 20:40:26",{"id":49,"slug":50,"title":51,"images":52,"datePosted":56,"authorName":57},303,"chevening-scholarship-2027-award-in-uk-fully-funded-opportunity","Chevening Scholarship 2027 Award In Uk: Fully Funded Opportunity",[53],{"fileName":54,"oldFileName":54,"type":18,"file":19,"url":55},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fchevening-scholarship-2027-award-in-uk-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c2d59792500.64054757_screenshot 2026-06-24 181051.png","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fchevening-scholarship-2027-award-in-uk-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c2d59792500.64054757_screenshot%202026-06-24%20181051.png","2026-06-24 20:17:45","Linkskool",{"id":59,"slug":60,"title":61,"images":62,"datePosted":66,"authorName":38},302,"secai-ai-scholarship-2026-in-germany-fully-funded-302","Secai Ai Scholarship 2026 In Germany: Fully Funded",[63],{"fileName":64,"oldFileName":64,"type":18