44.png","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fmccall-macbain-scholarship-2027-in-canada-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a35399f674831.63838755_screenshot%202026-06-19%20132844.png","2026-06-19 13:44:15",1782337549585]